t health and healthy habits in social situations."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": "Describes common health conditions by the use of the correct expressions, vocabulary and grammatical structures related to the communicative topics for this level."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Describes common health conditions by the use of the correct expressions, vocabulary and grammatical structures related to the communicative topics for this level."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Describes common health conditions by the use of the correct expressions, vocabulary and grammatical structures related to the communicative topics for this level."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Identifies general information in short written or spoken conversations about advice for a healthy lifestyle. "}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn4le11ob11re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Exploring Causes"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "You use these phrases to talk about or explore the causes of something.  Causes are the reasons why something happens.<br>  <br>Thanks to \u2026<br> It could be \u2026<br> Are you sure it's ... ?<br> Could that be it?<br> It's possible it's ..."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Thanks to the sushi I ate."}, {"type": "example", "content": " It's possible it's the sushi. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "Are you sure it's the chocolate?"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Common Health Problems and Giving Advice"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "<br>These are some common health problems.  When you talk about health problems, you usually use nouns. </br></br> What are some remedies or treatments for these problems in your country? </br></br> "}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":10,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Health Problem \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Meaning\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Stomachache \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A pain in your stomach \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Headache\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A pain in your head \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Earache \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A pain your ear \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sore throat \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A pain in your throat\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A cold \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" A common sickness caused by a virus.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"The flu \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A serious sickness caused by a virus \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Toothache \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A pain in your tooth \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Backache \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A pain in your back \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Cramp\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"A sharp pain in a muscle\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You use <span class=\"strong\">modals</span> like <span class=\"italic\">should</span> and <span class=\"italic\">must</span> to give advice. <br/> You can use <span class=\"italic\">should</span>  to give some \"soft\" advice. You think its a good idea, but it is not absolutely necessary. <br/> You can use <span class=\"italic\">must</span> to give very strong advice. You think it is very important."}, {"type": "example", "content": "You should get some rest."}, {"type": "example", "content": "You must sleep more."}, {"type": "example", "content": "You should drink this tea."}, {"type": "example", "content": "You must take the medicine."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "tricky"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "difficult"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: The directions are a little tricky."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le11ob11aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "These are words to review."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "quick "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "sudden; immediate "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Make a quick right."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le11ob11aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "lights "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "street signals (red, yellow and green lights to tell drivers to stop and go)"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": " Example: Take a right at the lights."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le11ob11aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "revolving doors"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "doors that turn at the entrance of a building"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Go through the revolving doors."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le11ob11aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": " to pick up "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "to get something from a store "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(verb)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: I want to pick up some desserts."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le11ob11aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "remedy "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a treatment for a sickness "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: My Aunt Nelly knows some remedies."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le11ob11aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "peppermint "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "leaves from a plant of the mint family "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You should try some peppermint tea."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le11ob11aud07"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "ginger ale "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a kind of soda made with ginger "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You should try some ginger ale."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le11ob11aud08"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "antacid"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "medicine to help stomach acidity "}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You should take an antacid."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn4le11ob11aud09"}]}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Create a list of 4 common illnesses."}, {"type": "text", "content": "From the list, choose one illness."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Act out the symptoms (use your body and face, but don't speak)."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Your partner has to guess the illness and offer a solution."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Switch roles."}]}, {"type": "takeaway_assessment", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "I talk about health problems and demonstrate symptoms."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I identify health problems and symptoms."}, {"type": "text", "content": "I communicate a diagnosis and offer solutions."}]}], "type": "sena"}